WEBVTT

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.150
<i>Morning, everyone! Chloe here.</i>

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.450
<i>Good morning. This is Yukari Nanahoshi.</i>

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:12.900
<i>We here at the PR department of ALCA 
will bring you the newest Foreigner news.</i>

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:18.590
<i>Hey, Yukarin, the weather is so great this 
morning. Doesn't it make you want to run?</i>

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:19.940
<i>I know what you mean.</i>

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.770
<i>I'm filled with a desire 
to do laundry myself!</i>

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>Chloe-senpai, if you've got anything that 
needs cleaning, put it out for me, okay?</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.270
<i>Thank you! Then how about we get started?</i>

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:33.430
<i>Well, first off, let's hear some 
Foreigner news. I'll leave it to you!</i>

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:37.010
<i>Right. Today, there were zero
Logicalist sorties.</i>

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Furthermore, there's been no news on recent</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.520
appearances of any Foreigners
we need to look out for.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.650
<i>Nothing interesting, huh?</i>

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>But it's so peaceful. 
I'd say that's a good thing!</i>

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.940
<i>You're right. It's been fun in its own way.</i>

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:49.890
<i>And lately,</i>

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>there's all kinds of jobs you can do
with Logicalist powers.</i>

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.930
<i>What's more, since there haven't been
any emergency missions,</i>

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:59.780
<i>we've got lots of time 
to play with our friends!</i>

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>Nothing but good news!</i>

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.290
<i>But still, I feel like I'm losing my edge if 
I can't go out and fight with all my strength.</i>

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.920
Miss! Miss! We're almost there!

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.400
Good morning.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.860
A very good morning to you.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.800
Mistress, I have a report for you.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.230
What's the matter, Karin?

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:20.320
Are you unaware of the new student 
transferring late into our class?

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:24.220
I am. I've heard she's a princess 
from a certain country.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:26.290
I'm looking forward to meeting her.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.910
She should be here shortly.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.380
I see that you're well informed.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:36.490
Because I research anything you 
might be interested in, Mistress!

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:39.100
That's my sister for you!

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.590
A princess.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.670
I'm sure she's someone filled 
with grace and dignity.

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:47.210
As a member of the Tachibana household, 
and the class representative,

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.810
I had better do my best 
to greet her properly.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.020
It's here! It's here! It's here! It's here!

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.810
What a high paradox level!

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.480
A Foreigner's got to be close by!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.680
Over there!

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.160
Huh? Stop right there! What about school?!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.670
After her, Karin, Karen!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.700
Mistress, just leave her be.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.240
I can't just let someone
be late!

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.770
I'm coming, too!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:18.760
Goodness, you're just so soft-hearted!

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.990
Fluffy?

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.710
Is something there?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.010
That was a person, wasn't it?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:10.890
It's Nina-chan!

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:13.900
I'm...

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:21.320
Who are you?

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.500
Is that enough food?

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.000
Oh, yup! It was super delicious!

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.130
What's your name?

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.100
Lion!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.040
And she's Belle.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.680
So you're Liones Yelistratova, I take it.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.470
Amazing! How did you know?

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.220
Because my teacher told me so.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:56.400
She asked me to take you 
to the staff room. But...

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.170
So fluffy...

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.570
There we go...

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.070
Thanks!

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:36.520
I only did it because
my teacher told me to.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.430
Let's go.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.430
Wait!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.630
Welcome to Pirari Academy.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.970
This academy is a training school for Logicalists,

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:22.190
managed by the Special Police Bureau ALCA.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.320
G-Got it!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.740
My name's Rino Fujisaki.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.310
I'm the assistant homeroom 
teacher for your class.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.780
Happy to meet you.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:33.060
I'm Lion! Pleased to meet you.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.240
What an energetic answer. 
You get a gold star.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.610
As someone who has the 
makings of a Logicalist,

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:41.250
I hope you'll show the same enthusiasm 
towards using your power properly.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.320
What's this?

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.140
It's called a Foreigner Card.

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:48.260
Last year, ALCA adopted this new system

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.470
after Tritomy gave us the technology.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.090
I understand.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:55.180
<i>I'm certain she doesn't at all.</i>

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.460
I'm going to explain it in class later,

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:00.060
so just take special care of it until then.

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:01.170
Got it!

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.640
Then shall we go?

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.480
You're in the same class as Nina, S class.

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.160
Yay!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:27.700
I-I-I-I-I'm Lion!

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:30.740
Please call me Liones Yelistratova.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:31.630
Way too hard.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.840
I'm your homeroom teacher, Kagura.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:37.090
If you have any questions, ask Miss Fujisaki.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:39.360
Got it!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.830
That's so cute!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.690
I wonder if she's registered on the cards.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.080
Don't tell me, she's...

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.410
Woah! It's the same reaction 
that I got this morning!

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:54.860
Yayoi.

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:56.630
Yes, Miss Kagura.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:58.810
Can you introduce her to 
our school afterwards?

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.620
But of course.

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:05.140
I am the class representative, 
Yayoi Tachibana.

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:09.340
On behalf of class 1-S, I'm happy to 
offer you a warm welcome, Lion-san.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.840
P-P-Pleased to meet—

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.620
She seems like quite the airhead.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.810
Or maybe a princess for the masses?

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.170
You mustn't say such rude things.

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:24.900
Well, it is true that she doesn't quite 
match the image of a princess I had in mind.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.780
What? But she's so cute.

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:30.890
So she's on the same
wavelength as Karen-chan...

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:34.340
You think I'm cute? Gosh!

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:36.370
I don't believe that's what she was implying.

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.700
Looks like we have some 
time before lunch break.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.940
We've also got a new student.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.840
How about we do a simple review?

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.260
Yayoi, can you tell us what a Logicalist is?

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:53.670
Yes.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:59.630
Logicalists are those who make a contract 
with Foreigners from other worlds.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:02.110
By entering a trance with the foreigner
they contracted with,

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.390
they gain a number of different powers.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.200
And what's their purpose?

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:12.050
To protect Septpia, that is,
this world, from evil Foreigners.

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.160
Yup!

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.040
One year ago, you'd be correct.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:18.590
But now that we've cleaned 
up the Archdemon invasion,

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.310
everything's become much more peaceful.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.520
At the very least, for the time being,

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:25.370
there's nothing compelling 
us to fight anymore.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:29.160
In that sense, you're 
all a bother to us now.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.410
How so?

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:35.570
Well, you've got six years until graduation.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.320
Take that time to think about it.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.050
All right! I'll do my best!

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:43.760
Crap!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.810
Mahiro-san! Not again!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.950
So this is your first time going to school?

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.060
It is!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:17.260
My country is really small, and I 
was the only child at the castle.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.970
So that's why I was so nervous back there.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:27.680
So how did you study?

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:31.230
My mom did teach me some things, but...

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.670
I don't think studying is my thing.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:35.950
Belle, what's the matter?

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:37.440
Her name's Belle?

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.430
What world did she come from?

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:41.730
Monolium? Tetra-Heaven?

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:45.260
No, her fur's kinda too different for that.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.750
Stop that at once, Mahiro-san!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.720
She doesn't seem to like it!

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:52.930
Hmm, she can't speak our language,

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:55.670
but she does seem to understand 
what we're saying.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.130
I don't really understand 
much about Belle, either.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.590
But she's been with me 
ever since I was a baby.

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.810
Huh? You haven't made a contract with her?

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.950
How could that be?

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.940
Lion-san is in class S!

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.680
C-Contract?

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.230
The only students that can enter class S

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.820
are those who have already made contact
with Foreigners.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.320
So having no contract is a bad thing?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.490
If you haven't, you'll have 
to go to another class.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:25.810
No! I was so happy to be
in the same class as Nina-chan!

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.560
It's all good! It'll work out somehow.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.410
Really?

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:32.470
You mustn't say something so irresponsible!

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:34.950
We have to check with our teachers first.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.230
Oh...

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.980
Hmm. Well, do you have a Foreigner Card?

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.720
Oh! I do!

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.680
This, right?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.930
Oh, it's blank.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:48.530
Is this also different
from everybody else's?

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:51.030
Well, it's still the first day.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:53.840
It just means you haven't 
formed a contract yet.

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:56.770
You needn't worry. It'll 
be all right. Probably...

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.260
Guess you'll just have to take
the option of last resort!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:02.110
How about we analyze Belle?!

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:11.770
Now, Mahiro-san! Stop that this instant!

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.740
It's not something we can 
simply look into ourselves!

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:18.670
No, no. We might just be able 
to figure something out!

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:22.880
Belle!

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:24.930
Just let me look at the tip
of its tail a bit!

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.540
Mahiro-san! I said cut that out!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.810
Karen-chan!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.060
-J-Just a little bit!

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:34.310
Gosh! What should I do!?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:43.410
What's happening?

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.090
Her gate opened!

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:50.210
Why are you crying, Lion?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:53.560
To think that we should meet again.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.540
I am overjoyed!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:02.130
She did it! Look, Lion can trance!

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:07.190
I am overjoyed.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:11.370
Wow! Look, look!

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:14.680
Now I can be with Nina-chan 
and everyone else!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:17.850
But...

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:19.360
Isn't she...

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.740
...going berserk right now?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.650
It's probably a Monolium Foreigner.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:30.610
She has the power to manipulate vegetation.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:33.830
So she'll be a short-range 
to mid-range type in battle!

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:42.750
What are you doing?

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:51.100
Gate Access. Tetra-Heaven!

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.370
Let's go, Amor.

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:58.100
Right, Nina-chan!

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:29.620
Come, everyone! Play with me!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.720
Lion! Do you have any super moves?

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.930
Super moves? Let's see...

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.770
You mustn't, Lion-san!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.800
This isn't the place to be using your power!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.540
How lovely!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.400
Don't tell me... a trance-jack?

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.480
No. That's not how it looks.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.460
But...

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:10.680
Liones-san.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:13.350
Come play with me!

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:14.510
What?

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:15.990
Nina-chan!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.390
Calm down!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.100
Where am I?

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:31.860
It's a bit different from the castle.

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:36.450
It's been ten years, hasn't it?

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.460
Who might you be?

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:46.380
What happened to you?

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.960
I tranced just now, didn't I?!

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.200
Yay!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.590
Now we can be in the same class!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:57.780
For now, it looks as though 
you've gone back to normal.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.670
YOU GUYS!

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:23.220
I never thought she'd be capable of
trancing with a blank card...

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.210
She was behaving quite dangerously, too.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.880
I shall put in an objection at 
the ALCA head office at once.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:34.850
I realize that this new system has 
only been in effect for half a year,

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.610
but as long as the students are using it,

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:39.030
I will do my utmost to ensure this sort 
of problem does not come up again.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:41.100
Kozue, you're so devoted.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:44.900
Preventing accidents before they happen 
is the responsibility of any educator.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:49.360
The commotion was limited.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:53.660
Those children are bound by a very deep bond.

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:56.570
That's all there is to it.

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:06.250
I'm so happy!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.210
I'm in the same dorm as Nina-chan!

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:15.660
What's the matter, Nina-chan?

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:19.180
You knew my name from the 
very beginning, didn't you?

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:22.110
Yup! I saw you on TV!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:28.160
But I never thought I'd get to meet you here.

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:29.270
That's...

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:33.330
I've always admired you.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.120
I want to be just like you.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.080
I want to be able to do my best for others.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:45.760
And I also thought...

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:48.290
If I could one day make 
friends with someone,

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.510
I hoped it would be someone 
like you, Nina-chan.

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:52.520
I've always felt that way.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:53.700
I'm sorry.

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:54.090
Huh?

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:59.260
The truth is, I don't plan to 
stay in this school for long.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:00.960
Why not?

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.260
I only came here on orders from my superiors.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.930
If I had my way, I'd return 
to ALCA as soon as possible.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:10.150
I'm already a Logicalist.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.110
I see.

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:16.100
So, even if we become friends—

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:18.070
I'm sure you'll get to go back!

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:21.060
Yup! You'll go back! It'll be fine!

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.010
I'm cheering for you!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:27.660
I am sad that we might have 
to part ways so soon...

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:28.880
But...

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.710
I'll be right on your tail!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:40.010
What?

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:43.930
Nothing. Let's go home, Liones-san.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.370
Sure.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:52.500
Hey, Nina-chan.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:56.520
What?

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.110
Um...

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:00.890
I'd rather...

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.580
...you call me Lion.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:25.360
Lion-san.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:27.770
That's good enough, right?

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:31.700
Nina-chan, I love you!

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:47.380
Goodness gracious, you're 
both completely soaked.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.120
What happened?

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:53.040
An unforeseen accident occurred.

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.250
Goodness gracious, so you're our new student.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:59.080
I'm Lion! And she's Belle!

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.680
Welcome home, Lion-chan, Belle-chan.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:05.560
I'm home! Um...

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:08.590
She's in grade 6, and 
her name is Yuko-senpai.

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:10.740
She's the dorm manager here 
at Shirakaba Dormitory.

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.890
If anything happens, feel free to come to me.

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:16.480
Okay, Yuko-senpai!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.690
All right, then to begin with...

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:21.440
Let's go straight to the baths.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:27.830
Yuko-senpai kind of reminds me of my mommy.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.860
She likes things clean and tidy,

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:32.160
so you'd better be careful.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.230
I'll do my best!

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.360
Are you guys already in the bath?

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:40.420
It's a special occasion, 
so why not come outside?

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:41.880
Outside?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.840
There's a bath outside!

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:48.850
Is that rare?

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.310
This is my first time!

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:55.220
It's like heaven.

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:56.520
Do you like it?

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:00.740
Lots! While I stowed away on the ship,

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:03.230
I couldn't take a bath at all.

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:05.790
Stowed away?!

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:08.280
Yeah. My dad was just so against me leaving.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:11.120
So I slipped in with the luggage 
and was a stowaway onboard.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.620
What did you do after you got off?

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.800
Hitch-hiked.

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.540
Sounds fun!

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:18.520
Yeah! It was really fun!

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:20.050
I thought so!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:21.940
Being fun or not isn't the issue here!

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:24.130
Doesn't this mean that you ran away from home?

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:25.470
Mommy knows about it.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:29.780
I never imagined we'd end up with 
such a wild princess on our hands.

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:32.540
That wasn't a compliment!

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:36.390
But, I do think your desire 
to become a Logicalist,

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:39.490
so much that you ran away from home,
 is very commendable.

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:42.900
You know what? I'm gonna try 
really, really hard here!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.490
And I'm gonna be an amazing Logicalist!

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.910
I'm not going to fall short myself!

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:51.760
I'll graduate at the top of my class!

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:54.010
And I'll be a top class Logicalist!

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:56.920
I plan to be chief of ALCA.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.680
And I shall accompany her!

00:21:58.680 --> 00:21:59.630
Me, too.

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:01.540
I see!

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:02.820
Mahiro-chan, how about you?

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:04.540
Whatever's good.

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:10.660
She's got the talent to be a Logicalist, but 
she doesn't have the desire to do so at all!

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:14.400
I'll be happy if I can just 
do research on Foreigners.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:17.840
But I think that's a fine dream in itself.

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:20.640
If you figure anything out 
about Belle, let me know!

00:22:20.640 --> 00:22:24.100
In other words, I'm free to 
do whatever I want with her?

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:28.500
And Nina-chan...

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:33.740
Oh, umm...

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:37.050
Nina-san has actual experience 
on the battlefield.

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:39.200
She's different from us.

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:41.250
I'm sure you learned that 
yourself after today.

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:43.210
Yeah, you're right.

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:46.170
All right!

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:49.310
Let's all make our dreams come true!

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:52.740
Huh? What?

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:56.180
There's two Nina-chans... three...

00:22:56.180 --> 00:23:00.400
Wow, there's so many Nina-chans...

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:04.320
It looks like she stayed in too long.

00:23:04.840 --> 00:23:06.210
Sure does.

00:23:06.210 --> 00:23:07.650
Lion-san!

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.380
Are you okay?

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:11.380
She's a boiled octopus!

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:16.900
Episode 1

00:23:13.400 --> 00:23:16.900
Send your cute Hina  on a journey!

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:22.100
Senpai! Will you listen to me?

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:26.680
I heard that once you're over 24, your 
skin can't repel water anymore.

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:29.030
But aren't I still only 24?

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:31.950
So I thought it was impossible 
and tested it out in the bath...

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:42.940
Next Episode

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:34.530
And it sucked up all the water!

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:36.980
My skin's already taken a 
turn for the worse!

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:39.800
Man, I admire girls in their early 
teens with their beautiful, clear skin.

00:23:39.800 --> 00:23:42.940
And I'm only 24!

00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:49.170
Fujisaki, I'm 25.
